sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CHM as Chat Modal
    participant TP as Tasks Panel
    participant TM as Task Manager
    participant W as AI Worker
    participant API as Backend API
    participant WD as Workers Dashboard

    Note over U, CHM: User in active chat session
    CHM->>U: Display active tasks panel
    TP->>U: Show 4 tasks in progress
    TP->>U: Show task statistics (3 Active, 2 Running, 1 Paused)
    
    Note over U, TP: User wants to pause a running task
    U->>TP: Select task checkbox
    U->>TP: Click "Pause Selected"
    TP->>TM: Pause task request
    TM->>W: Send pause signal
    W->>TM: Acknowledge pause
    TM->>API: Update task status to "Paused"
    API->>TP: Confirm status update
    TP->>U: Update task card to "Paused"
    TP->>U: Update statistics (2 Active, 1 Running, 2 Paused)
    
    Note over U, TP: User wants to resume paused task
    U->>TP: Select different task checkbox
    U->>TP: Click "Resume Selected"
    TP->>TM: Resume task request
    TM->>W: Send resume signal
    W->>TM: Acknowledge resume
    W->>TM: Continue task execution
    TM->>API: Update task status to "Running"
    API->>TP: Confirm status update
    TP->>U: Update task card to "Running"
    TP->>U: Update statistics (3 Active, 2 Running, 1 Paused)
    
    Note over U, TP: User wants to terminate a task
    U->>TP: Select problematic task
    U->>TP: Click "Terminate Selected"
    TP->>U: Show confirmation dialog
    U->>TP: Confirm termination
    TP->>TM: Terminate task request
    TM->>W: Send termination signal
    W->>W: Clean up resources
    W->>TM: Acknowledge termination
    TM->>API: Update task status to "Terminated"
    API->>TP: Confirm status update
    TP->>U: Remove task from active list
    TP->>U: Update statistics (2 Active, 2 Running, 0 Paused)
    
    Note over U, TP: User creates new task
    U->>TP: Click "New Task"
    TP->>CHM: Focus on chat input
    CHM->>U: Prompt for task description
    U->>CHM: Enter new task description
    CHM->>W: Send task request
    W->>TM: Create new task
    TM->>API: POST /api/tasks/create
    API->>TM: Return task ID
    TM->>TP: Add task to active list
    TP->>U: Show new task card
    TP->>U: Update statistics (3 Active, 3 Running, 0 Paused)
    
    Note over U, TP: Bulk operations
    U->>TP: Select multiple tasks
    U->>TP: Click "Pause Selected" (bulk)
    TP->>TM: Bulk pause request
    
    loop For each selected task
        TM->>W: Send pause signal
        W->>TM: Acknowledge pause
        TM->>API: Update task status
    end
    
    API->>TP: Bulk status update confirmation
    TP->>U: Update all selected task cards
    TP->>U: Update statistics
    
    Note over CHM, WD: Status propagation to dashboard
    TM->>WD: Update worker utilization metrics
    WD->>WD: Recalculate performance metrics
    WD->>U: Show updated dashboard (when navigated back) 